  "page": "page-04",
  "idea": "LocalSend: share files between iPhone, Android, and PC with zero cables",
  "text": "This free open-source app transfers photos, videos, and documents instantly over Wi-Fi. Trying to move huge asset packs to a client laptop usually requires hunting down USB dongles. Physical flash drives get misplaced, carry security risks, and fail when ports do not match. Open LocalSend on both devices to stream folders directly across local subnets without third-party servers. You share massive media folders without configuration headaches.",
